The '''Marine Starter''' is the starting island for new players who choose the [[Marines]] team and is one of the three non-PvP/Safe Zone areas in the [[First Sea]]. Players who join the [[Pirates]] team will spawn on the [[Pirate Starter]] island.

==Appearance==
The Marine Starter is a multi-level island. It has a dock at the front that leads up to the first level, which features a long street. The next level contains a field where '''[[Trainee|Trainees]]''' can be found, along with a quest giver and several houses. At the back of the island are three large stone towers with staircases wrapping around them. Every tower has cannons on top, and the left-most one also displays a black flag.

===Port===
The port of Marine Starter is medium-sized, with two docks that can accommodate two ships at a time. It is located on the southeastern end of the island.

