==Trivia==
* The Marine Starter features [[Wanted Poster|wanted posters]], allowing [[Marines]] to easily collect them.
* Like the [[Pirate Starter]] island, the [[Pirate Recruiter]] is placed in an partially hidden location, likely to avoid being seen by [[Marines]].
* Ironically, the Marine Starter displays a black flag on the left tower—a symbol commonly associated with pirates—even though it is a military establishment.
* The marine starter offer 2 silver chests and 1 gold chest.
* Returning to/joining a friend in the [[First Sea]] from the [[Second Sea]] or [[Third Sea]] as a [[Marines|Marine]] will teleport the player over to Marine Starter.
*If the player hasn't been to the first sea in some time it will be set as home point if the player chooses [[Marines|Marine]].

